              "principle": 7,
              "diagnosis": "PAY, 'Accept card payments', places BANK, the unfamiliar bank API integration, after UI and COPY. BANK depends on an external team and has no de-risking spike, so integration surprises would arrive after the earlier work, leaving less time to adjust the payment plan.",
              "recommended_action": "Propose moving BANK earlier or adding a small integration spike before committing to its full scope, respecting human-curated sequencing."
